      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 2009, the area had transformed into an entertainment hub, attracting restaurants, bars, and upscale condominiums near Downtown Houston.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
