      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Clubs on Washington Avenue once added jitneys to ferry patrons between venues, easing crowd flow during peak nights.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Avenue_(Houston%2C_Texas)",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Washington Avenue’s evolution mirrors Houston’s broader nightlife shift, with many clubs closing as the scene migrated to Midtown and the East End.",
